{"id":383,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"基礎学力と自学自習を育む中学課程","feature_description":"桜美林中学校では「基礎学力の定着」と「自学自習の確立」を学習指導のねらいに掲げています。生徒が学ぶ意義を理解し、興味関心を持って楽しく学ぶことを通じて、自学自習を習慣づける方針です。中学3年間で基礎を身につけ、高校では多様な進路に応じたカリキュラムに進みます。中学校では各学年の科目と単位数を示し、シラバスも公開しています。","clubs":[{"id":7099,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7100,"name":"サッカー（男子）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7101,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7102,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7103,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7104,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7105,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7106,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7107,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7108,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7109,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7110,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7111,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":7112,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.obirin.ed.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"202